Name "Slag Processor"

Every 20 ticks do

    Input kubejs:*_slag From Slag_Src Top Side Slots 0-3
        Output retain 16 Each kubejs:*_slag To Each Processor
    forget 

End

Every 20 ticks do

    Input From Each Processor Slots 1-4
        Output To Collector Top Side Slots 9-12
    forget

End

Every 20 ticks do

    Input kubejs:*_slag From Slag_Src Top Side Slots 4-6
        Output retain 16 Each kubejs:*_slag To Each Pulverizer
    forget
 
End

Every 20 ticks do

    Input From Each Pulverizer Slots 1-4
        Output To Collector Top Side Slots 9-12
    forget

End

Every 20 ticks do

    Input fluid:kubejs:used_lava From Slag_Src Top Side Slots 7-8
        Output fluid:kubejs:used_lava To Each Refinery
    forget

    Input Except fluid:kubejs:used_lava From Each Refinery
        Output To Collector Top Side Slots 13-15
    forget

End